# Make Formal Wear (Q037), first part: a level 60 character accepts at Alexis; Leikar gives a signet
# ring, which Jeremy trades for ice wine; Mist takes the wine; Jeremy then bakes a box of cookies,
# which Leikar takes, and the quest waits at its sixth step for the cloth, jewel box and sewing kit
# of the helper quests; then relog. The character holds adena and soulshots, which the quest never
# reads, so no NPC of the scenario gets object id 103, a number Alexis's own page lists as a buy
# list. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q037_make_formal_wear.golden
character Tailor 60
hold 57 1000
hold 1835 100
script quest.Q037_MakeFormalWear
